        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1536872825520-f5673b8e7217?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NjI2NzMxNTR8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post lima" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;lima-vmlima&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/lima-vm/lima&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;lima-vm/lima&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://lima-vm.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;[🌎&lt;strong&gt;Web site&lt;/strong&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://lima-vm.io/docs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;[📖&lt;strong&gt;Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://slack.cncf.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;[👤&lt;strong&gt;Slack (&lt;code&gt;#lima&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;picture&gt;
  &lt;source media=&#34;(prefers-color-scheme: dark)&#34; srcset=&#34;website/static/images/logo-dark.svg&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img alt=&#34;Shows a stylized &#39;Lima&#39; text in bold, modern font&#34; src=&#34;website/static/images/logo.svg&#34; width=400 /&gt;
&lt;/picture&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;lima-linux-machines&#34;&gt;Lima: Linux Machines
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://deepwiki.com/lima-vm/lima&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Ask DeepWiki&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/6505&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/6505/badge&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;OpenSSF Best Practices&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://scorecard.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/lima-vm/lima&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://api.scorecard.dev/projects/github.com/lima-vm/lima/badge&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;OpenSSF Scorecard&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://lima-vm.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Lima&lt;/a&gt; launches Linux virtual machines with automatic file sharing and port forwarding (similar to WSL2).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The original goal of Lima was to promote &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://containerd.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;containerd&lt;/a&gt; including &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/containerd/nerdctl&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;nerdctl (contaiNERD ctl)&lt;/a&gt;
to Mac users, but Lima can be used for non-container applications as well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lima also supports other container engines (Docker, Podman, Kubernetes, etc.) and non-macOS hosts (Linux, NetBSD, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting started
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set up (Homebrew):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;brew install lima
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;limactl start
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To run Linux commands:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;lima uname -a
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To run containers with containerd:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;lima nerdctl run --rm hello-world
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To run containers with Docker:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;limactl start template://docker
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;DOCKER_HOST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;limactl list docker --format &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;unix://{{.Dir}}/sock/docker.sock&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;docker run --rm hello-world
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To run containers with Kubernetes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;limactl start template://k8s
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;KUBECONFIG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;limactl list k8s --format &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;unix://{{.Dir}}/copied-from-guest/kubeconfig.yaml&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;kubectl apply -f ...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://lima-vm.io/docs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://lima-vm.io/docs/&lt;/a&gt; for the further information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We welcome contributions! Please see our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://lima-vm.io/docs/community/contributing/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contributing Guide&lt;/a&gt; for details on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Certificate of Origin (DCO)&lt;/strong&gt;: All commits must be signed off with &lt;code&gt;git commit -s&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code licensing and pull request guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;community&#34;&gt;Community
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;adopters&#34;&gt;Adopters
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Container environments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://rancherdesktop.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Rancher Desktop&lt;/a&gt;: Kubernetes and container management to the desktop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/abiosoft/colima&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Colima&lt;/a&gt;: Docker (and Kubernetes) on macOS with minimal setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/runfinch/finch&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Finch&lt;/a&gt;: Finch is a command line client for local container development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://podman-desktop.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Podman Desktop&lt;/a&gt;: Podman Desktop GUI has a plug-in for Lima virtual machines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GUI:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/unixorn/lima-xbar-plugin&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Lima xbar plugin&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://xbarapp.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;xbar&lt;/a&gt; plugin to start/stop VMs from the menu bar and see their running status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/afbjorklund/lima-gui&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;lima-gui&lt;/a&gt;: Qt GUI for Lima&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;communication-channels&#34;&gt;Communication channels
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;!-- Duplicated from https://lima-vm.io/docs/community/ --&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/lima-vm/lima/discussions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;GitHub Discussions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;#lima&lt;/code&gt; channel in the CNCF Slack
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New account: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://slack.cncf.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://slack.cncf.io/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Login: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cloud-native.slack.com/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://cloud-native.slack.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zoom meetings (tentatively monthly)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting notes &amp;amp; agenda proposals: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/lima-vm/lima/discussions/categories/meetings&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/lima-vm/lima/discussions/categories/meetings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calendar: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://zoom-lfx.platform.linuxfoundation.org/meetings/lima&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://zoom-lfx.platform.linuxfoundation.org/meetings/lima&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;code-of-conduct&#34;&gt;Code of Conduct
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lima follows the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/cncf/foundation/blob/main/code-of-conduct.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;CNCF Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://cncf.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Cloud Native Computing Foundation&lt;/a&gt; incubating project.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
